    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_33673dd9",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent-description; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a man pushing a woman in a shopping cart in a parking lot, both appearing to be laughing and enjoying themselves. The text overlay reads 'when you've had a long day but you need to but geroceries' (with a misspelling of 'groceries'). The overall intent of the meme is to humorously depict a relatable, everyday scenario of someone being overly tired or lazy but still needing to run errands. The image is used to create a lighthearted, comedic effect by juxtaposing the absurdity of being pushed in a shopping cart with the mundane task of grocery shopping. There is no toxicity present in this meme. It does not contain any abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements. The meme relies on situational humor and does not target any specific group or individual based on protected characteristics. The intent is to evoke laughter and a sense of shared experience with the viewer.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_3f138196"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
