      "description": "A man wearing a brown jacket over a white t-shirt and gray shorts, smiling as he pushes a shopping cart. He appears to be exerting effort but is enjoying the moment. His ethnicity is not clearly identifiable from the image alone, and no stereotypes or disparaging metaphors are present in the visual material.",
